                "loc": "LUK.21.5+LUK.21.6+LUK.21.7+LUK.21.8+LUK.21.9+LUK.21.10+LUK.21.11+LUK.21.12+LUK.21.13+LUK.21.14+LUK.21.15+LUK.21.16+LUK.21.17+LUK.21.18+LUK.21.19+LUK.21.20+LUK.21.21+LUK.21.22+LUK.21.23+LUK.21.24+LUK.21.25+LUK.21.26+LUK.21.27+LUK.21.28+LUK.21.29+LUK.21.30+LUK.21.31+LUK.21.32+LUK.21.33+LUK.21.34+LUK.21.35+LUK.21.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 21:5-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.1+MAT.24.2+MAT.24.3+MAT.24.4+MAT.24.5+MAT.24.6+MAT.24.7+MAT.24.8+MAT.24.9+MAT.24.10+MAT.24.11+MAT.24.12+MAT.24.13+MAT.24.14+MAT.24.15+MAT.24.16+MAT.24.17+MAT.24.18+MAT.24.19+MAT.24.20+MAT.24.21+MAT.24.22+MAT.24.23+MAT.24.24+MAT.24.25+MAT.24.26+MAT.24.27+MAT.24.28+MAT.24.29+MAT.24.30+MAT.24.31+MAT.24.32+MAT.24.33+MAT.24.34+MAT.24.35+MAT.24.36+MAT.24.37+MAT.24.38+MAT.24.39+MAT.24.40+MAT.24.41+MAT.24.42+MAT.24.43+MAT.24.44+MAT.24.45+MAT.24.46+MAT.24.47+MAT.24.48+MAT.24.49+MAT.24.50+MAT.24.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24:1-51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaarugire omuri hekalu, omwe aha beegi be yaamugira ati: Mwegyesa, reeba amabaare aga n'ebyombeko ebi ku biri eby'okutangaaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaamugira ati: Nooreeba ebyombeko ebi ku biri bihango? Kwonka tihariho ibaare eriritsigara riri aha rindi eritarinagwa hansi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaabaire ashutami omu kibungo kya Zeituuni ahashungaine na hekalu, Petero na Yakobo na Yohaana na Anderea baamubuuza omu mubonano, nibagira bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tugambire ebi ahu biribeeraho, kandi ni kamanyiso ki akaryoreka obunaku obu ebi byona birihikiirizibwamu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaatandika kubagarukamu ati: Mwerinde hatarigira omuntu weena owaabahabisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baingi baryaija omu iziina ryangye nibagira bati: Niinye Kristo! Kandi baryahabisa baingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku murihurira engamba n'okurangaanwa kwazo, mutaritiina; ebyo bishemereire kubaho; kwonka emperu yo eryaba etakahikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.19.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 19:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eihanga riryateera erindi ihanga, n'obugabe buryateera obundi bugabe; haryabaho emitsitsa omu myanya mingi, haryabaho n'enjara; ebyo niyo ntandikiro y'obusaasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
